This is a PLACEHOLDER for demo.gif.

Replace this file with an actual animated GIF captured from a terminal session.

What the real demo.gif would show:
- A terminal recording (~15 second loop) of running:
    bash examples/demo-project/run-demo.sh
- Three skills running sequentially with their terminal output
- The generated report files appearing in the output
- A clean, looped demo showing the full workflow from start to finish

Tools recommended to generate the real asset:
- asciinema (terminal recording) + agg (asciinema-to-GIF converter)
- QuickTime Player screen recording + ffmpeg to convert to GIF
- peek (Linux) or Kap (macOS) for direct GIF capture